# Tests

When to write and run tests: [docs/change-code-steps.md](docs/change-code-steps.md).

- Name specs `*.spec.ts` or `*.spec.tsx`.
- Put a new unit spec next to the module (`src/{lib,hooks,components,stores,routes}/**/__tests__/`).
- `src/__tests__/` is only Vitest setup, render helpers, and app-level specs — do not add module tests there.
- E2E specs live in `e2e/`.
